## How to run

- Keep the existing entrypoint files in the repo root for compatibility.
- If you want to import the cleaned config/runtime package, use:
  - `from src.config import *`
  - `from src.runtime.bot_entry import *`
- The original root entrypoints remain in place so the application keeps the same runtime behavior.

